<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dong Ah 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Dong Ah 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		    528    vs    1,079</p>
<p>    Net			    205    vs	328</p>
<p>    Turnover		  25,285    vs   22,080</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>		 in cash	    10    vs	 12</p>
<p>    Dividend Payment	  In early April</p>
<p>Note - Dong Ah Construction Co's share capital rose to 41.37 million shares due to 3.59 million shares in rights issue and a $200 million depositary receipt.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
